    13	- Worker provisioning-job outcome writes distinguish cancelled jobs from stale lease ownership: `JobRepository.Transition` returns `apierr.JobCancelled()` / `E_JOB_CANCELLED` when an expected-lease outcome targets a job already moved to `cancelled`, while lease-owner mismatch on an active/reclaimed job remains `apierr.JobNotClaimed()` / `E_JOB_NOT_CLAIMED`.
