    15	- Reconciliation-service-type stories should pin the subtype with a focused `internal/controlplane/reconcile/*_test.go` matrix while updating the canonical closed-set table when a new `ActionType` / `DriftReason` is introduced. Build/source config drift is value-bearing like env vars: route desired values only through Repairer-only fields (`Action.DesiredBuild`), keep `Type`/`Kind`/`Reason`/IDs value-free, and normalize build settings before diffing so renderer defaults (blank builder => dockerfile, blank dockerfile path => `Dockerfile`) do not create false positives.
