+- Results
+  - All run Go tests, race tests, vet, focused suites, and golangci-lint passed.
+  - No Postgres URL was required by this source-adapter story; migration tests that require database access keep using existing skip behavior when `YALLA_TEST_DATABASE_URL` is unset.
+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
