+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
+  - The adapter emits unattributed source samples only. BE-0572 must map Traefik labels/Dokploy names to Yalla tenant resources and quarantine unknown series before any billing-grade write.
+  - Later tracked-metric stories must decide which normalized samples become `usage_events` and customer-visible usage counters.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - Keep source adapters deterministic and side-effect-free; query collection, attribution, and billing writes are separate layers.
+  - Raw Prometheus sample checksums should be computed from the fixed query set and response bodies so duplicate windows can be audited and replayed.
+  - Missing service or histogram bucket labels should be counted as dropped source series at this layer, not guessed or billed.
+---

